  "description": "Perfectly positioned facing the navigation canal in Puerto Aventuras, Casa Angelica offers total immersion in nautical elegance. This majestic property, set on a sprawling 10,818 sq ft lot, is designed for those seeking an exclusive waterfront lifestyle. It is a sophisticated haven that combines the prestige of the Riviera Maya with the intimacy of a true family home.\n\nThe Fluidity of Spaces\nThe home unfolds over 4,887 sq ft of living space, distributed with remarkable architectural intelligence. The main level centers around a vast living room with an integrated office, an elegant dining area, and a fully equipped kitchen with a peninsula counter. Upstairs, the primary suite opens onto a private terrace with unobstructed views of the canal, complemented by two additional large bedrooms and the invaluable asset of an independent guest house located above the garage.\n\nAn Oasis of Privacy\nThe exterior is a true celebration of the Caribbean climate, designed for entertaining and relaxing with zero friction. A beautiful swimming pool is integrated into lush landscaping, extended by a large terrace ideal for gatherings. Direct access to the navigation canal offers a rare dimension, allowing boating enthusiasts to link their residence to the sea, while enjoying an expansive private garage with space for four vehicles.\n\nThe Lifestyle\nResiding in this estate guarantees the absolute security of the Puerto Aventuras gated community and immediate access to all its premium amenities. Whether as a primary residence or a high yield investment asset, this property represents a premier real estate opportunity for $1,800,000 USD. It is a seamless and immediate transition to coastal refinement.",
